WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:18.329
Tina: The coast is clear.

2
00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.639
Bello: Where are we?

3
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.897
Tina: We’re in the schoolyard.

4
00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:26.832
Tina: Danny, Brad, and I always play around these bushes.

5
00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:32.532
Bello: Okay, let’s look for a clue.

6
00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:36.349
Tina: I don’t see anything. Do you?

7
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.641
Bello: I think I found something.

8
00:00:38.642 --> 00:00:42.281
Look over here.

9
00:00:42.282 --> 00:00:44.428
Tina: The grass is burnt.

10
00:00:44.429 --> 00:00:48.955
It looks like there was an explosion.

11
00:00:48.956 --> 00:00:54.882
Bello: Tina, what’s that?

12
00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:59.020
Tina: It . . . it looks like some kind of gun.

13
00:00:59.021 --> 00:01:01.844
Bello: It’s a strange looking gun.

14
00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:04.036
Tina: What’s that?

15
00:01:04.037 --> 00:01:07.289
Bello: I think it’s some kind of putty.

16
00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.000
Tina: This gun does look like something Brad would build.

17
00:01:11.001 --> 00:01:14.316
Bello: That means Danny and Brad must be nearby.

18
00:01:14.317 --> 00:01:17.703
Tina: But it’s so poorly made . . .

19
00:01:17.704 --> 00:01:31.967
Bello: I wonder what caused the explosion.

20
00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.194
Tina: Bello?

21
00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:37.283
Bello: Are you okay, Tina?

22
00:01:37.284 --> 00:01:40.988
Tina: I’m fine. But look at yourself.

23
00:01:40.989 --> 00:01:42.407
Bello: Oh my gosh!

24
00:01:42.408 --> 00:01:46.460
I’m as small as you!

25
00:01:46.461 --> 00:01:50.700
Bello: I’m small! I’ve never been small in my life.

26
00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.498
Tina: I’ve never been this small, either.

27
00:01:53.499 --> 00:01:54.839
Bello: We were right!

28
00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.324
Bello: Danny and Brad must have shrunk Chuck and Dave.

29
00:01:58.325 --> 00:02:00.873
Tina: We’ve got to find them!

30
00:02:00.874 --> 00:02:03.475
Bello: And we have to reverse this.

31
00:02:03.476 --> 00:02:07.764
How can I help Danny if I’m this small!

32
00:02:07.765 --> 00:02:09.994
Tina: Do you hear that?

33
00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:13.017
Bello: It sounds like someone is coming this way.

34
00:02:13.018 --> 00:02:22.604
Tina: Quick, hide!

35
00:02:22.605 --> 00:02:26.168
Mite Leader: This is what the invaders used to climb the wall.

36
00:02:26.169 --> 00:02:30.508
Mite Leader: We must take it down.

37
00:02:30.509 --> 00:02:32.181
Mite 1: All together.

38
00:02:32.182 --> 00:02:34.128
Mite 2: On the count of three.

39
00:02:34.129 --> 00:02:41.328
All Mites: One, two, three!

40
00:02:41.329 --> 00:02:43.848
Mite 1: It’s too heavy.

41
00:02:43.849 --> 00:02:46.381
Mite 2: I think there’s something inside.

42
00:02:46.382 --> 00:02:48.487
Mite Leader: Get it out, whatever it is.

43
00:02:48.488 --> 00:02:50.053
And do it quickly.

44
00:02:50.054 --> 00:02:55.675
All Mites: Yes, sir!

45
00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:57.554
Mite 2: Look! More invaders!

46
00:02:57.555 --> 00:02:58.978
Mite 1: Get them!

47
00:02:58.979 --> 00:03:00.485
Tina: Oh no!

48
00:03:00.486 --> 00:03:08.321
Bello: Run, Tina, run!

49
00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:11.440
Tina: Look out!

50
00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:14.877
Mite Leader: Invaders! Capture them!

51
00:03:14.878 --> 00:03:16.903
Bello: This isn’t good!

52
00:03:16.904 --> 00:03:20.675
Mite Leader: Quiet, prisoner.
